# Hard Times Come Again No More: Stephen Foster (1854), his own four verses.
{title: Hard Times Come Again No More}
{composer: Stephen Foster}
{key: G}
{tempo: 76}
{time: 4/4}
{x_level: 2}
{x_strum: D - D U - U D U}

